 | SEALMASTER FLEXI
 | MS Polymer Hybrid Sealant Compound
 | TECHNICAL DATA SHEET VER NO. N.1
PRODUCT DESCRIPTIONS
Trubuild Sealmaster Flexi is a high quality, single-component, elastomeric joint sealant based on MS-Polymer. Once
applied, the compound reacts with atmospheric moisture to form a tough and durable elastic seal.
 | FEATURES & ADVANTAGES
 | HIGH ADHESIVE | PAINTABLE | UV AND | ELASTIC
 | STRENGTH | WEATHER RESISTANT
 | High adhesive strength on most | Excellent weather resistance
 | substrates | Can be painted
 | Superior mechanical properties | Does not contain isocyanates, hence safe
 | Permanently elastic after cure
 | UV resistant
AREAS OF APPLICATION | PACKAGING
 | 600 ml
 • For gap ﬁlling. • Sealing control and expansion joint. • Bonding of
 metals, glass, ceramics.
METHOD OF APPLICATION
Step-1: | Clean the application area and make it dry & free from grease and detergents.
Step-2: | Mask adjacent surfaces for neat application.
Step-3: | Cut tip of sausage and put into the sausage gun. Consider your required bead width and remove an appropriate
 | section from the end of the nozzle.
Step-4: | Apply sealant in continuous, steady ﬂow. Push the sealant ahead in the nozzle contacting both sides of joint so it is
 | completely ﬁlled.
Step-5: | Smoothen sealant surface immediately after application before skin forms using a spatula dipped in mild detergent.
Step-6: | Remove the masking tape before sealant skins. Excess sealant should be removed immediately with a clean cloth
 | damped in mineral turpentine.
