HANDLING PRECAUTIONS
Mandatory and recommended industrial hygiene procedures should be followed whenever our products are being handled
and used. For additional information please read Material Safety Data Sheets.
THEORETICAL COVERAGE
• For width 5 mm and depth 5 mm, approx. coverage will be 26 RMT/kg.
NOTE: Coverage will depend upon the size of the groove. Always test the product for suitability before use.
STORAGE
Product should be stored in a dry place in its original, properly closed sausage packing at temperature between 2 - 40°C.
Chemical should be consumed once opened.
SHELF LIFE
12 months from the date of manufacturing
